      <Output>
        <StdOut>SCM fixture and evidence: C:\Users\Martin\AppData\Local\Temp\softwareschmiede_scm_e2e_68170d9ffd8a4b8283bcdcf2beb5b2ee&#xD;
E1: real reception, original body/origin, one receipt/waiting comment, replay and back navigation passed.&#xD;
E5: regular app close/restart preserves inbox and does not repeat remote receipts.&#xD;
E2: single-plugin dialog/cancel/reopen, active task, exactly one prompt per event, delivered/accepted/completed and live-run reuse passed. Worktree was pre-seeded.&#xD;
E2-Filter: processed/waiting rows and counts correct without dispatch/remote side effects.&#xD;
E4: completed/archived/paused remain blocked; regular pause removal permits processing.&#xD;
E3: active task without session, visible simulator start failure and successful retry passed.&#xD;
E6: issue/PR comment and description bodies reach real file channel, descriptions have no receipt, replies target stored reference and no completion reaction.&#xD;
E6-Wiederaufnahme (403 after acceptance): pending remote reply retried without new event prompt/attempt.&#xD;
E3-Bereitschaft: identified live run with unknown readiness requires explicit confirmation and receives one prompt.&#xD;
E6-Kanal: unavailable channel blocks event input, retains foreign contents and resumes exactly once after repair.&#xD;
E6-Wiederaufnahme: persisted waiting request survives 401 and missing repository permission, then processes once.&#xD;
E2-Clone: unprepared task creates real clone/branch under isolated workdir, starts CLI and dispatches once.&#xD;
E3-Dialog: missing CLI/settings retains inbox; concurrent real start during modal selection reuses single run and prompt.&#xD;
E3-Bereitschaft: double click/poll dispatch once; confirmation captured for A rejects replacement B; fresh B confirmation required.&#xD;
E3-Bereitschaft/Kanal: readiness confirmation cannot unblock occupied channel; repair sends exactly once.&#xD;
E6-Read-only: regular task stop/restart replaces denied run; only new supported run receives one event.&#xD;
E3-Ungewissheit: status/cancel preserves attempt; confirmed resend once; late old completion cannot finish current attempt.&#xD;
E3-Ungewissheit: late valid completion of still-current attempt resolves without any resend.&#xD;
E7-Anlage: qualified event on unassigned reference creates exactly one task with issue reference and inbox entry.&#xD;
E8: auto-created task waits actionably without default CLI; queue selection starts clone/CLI and delivers exactly once.</StdOut>
